   165	/**
   166	 * Contact channels are optional per storefront, and a value arriving from Contentful may be
   167	 * unsafe. Both cases fall through to a labelled, non-interactive span. Adding the placeholder
   168	 * hrefs to the fixture made that branch unreachable from every other story, so it needs its own.
   169	 */
